or BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T23:21:55-07:00","id":961475,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/960027-what-monsters-are-left?p=961443#post961443\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm pretty sure the original invisible man would be a deviant, since he was the result of an experiment.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, you're probably right...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T02:39:16-07:00","id":961541,"title":"","content":"Succubi/incubi there are so many different types of succubi myths around the world.<br /> <br /> Some myths are based demons, others ghosts, others deities, others fey, ect...<br /> <br /> Splats would be broken down into taints and fetishes.<br /> <br /> Like Taints (name is a work in progress) would be based on mythological sources, like the traditional demonic themed incubi/succubi, Ghostly incubi/succubi, angellic/diefic succubi/incubi, Fey Succubi/incubi, alien incubi/succubi.<br /> <br /> Then choose a fetish that has a benifit, but also a requirement for feeding.<br /> <br /> Power Stat Mojo.<br /> <br /> Fuel Stat: Ecstacy<br /> <br /> To gain Ecstacy from sex with a mortal you have to have the mortals willingness/consent, no Succubus: the Magic Roofie crap, this isn't lost girl, to feed they have to be willing.<br /> <br /> The game would be about how you deal with people's judgements, juggling relationships and consquences, and religious presucution.<br /> <br /> The big bad would be The Chaste, a demonic order of prudes, that are normally out of phase with reality, that finds humans reproductive urges to be gross, and manipulate humans into judgemental mobs, exploiting religions, bigotries, jealousies ect..., to move their adgenda forward.<br /> <br /> Its meant to invert the usually horror trope of evil seducer, this time the seducer is the good guy and the prude is the blood thirsty demons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T03:40:44-07:00","id":961549,"title":"","content":"That feels far too black and white for the CofD; and perhaps a bit to on the nose regarding intersecting with real world oppressed sexual minorities.<br /> <br /> What seems to mostly separate them from doing this with Vampire, Changeling, or Beast (all of which can easily be twists on the evil seducer stuff in one way or another) is that you're making it a mechanical requirement to obtain consent. The only inherent conflict this leaves is the kind of cartoony, &quot;the Prude Police want to stop your completely consensual sexy fun times!&quot;<br /> <br /> I'm not trying to trivialize the complexity of maintaining multiple relationships (or even a polycule of some sort), but you basically find your way into the primal and poly crowd, and you're 99% set for everything but the Prude Police coming to ruin it for you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T06:07:14-07:00","id":961614,"title":"","content":"I kinda feel like Beast already has the Inccubus/Succubus thing well-covered anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T06:37:45-07:00","id":961624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/960027-what-monsters-are-left?p=961614#post961614\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I kinda feel like Beast already has the Inccubus/Succubus thing well-covered anyway.</div> </div> </div> </div> Really? Honestly, reading the Beast core book at no point did I think Succubus. Maybe I'll reread it, but Beasts seem less about sex and seduction, and more about scaring the shit out of people.<br /> <br /> Plus I think my Succubus/Incubus idea explores very different themes then Beast over all, Beast is about fear and hunger, Succubus/Incubus would be about how do you deal with a judgemental society when your sexual nature is so outside the normal and taboo.<br /> <br /> Still I'll reread Beast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T06:55:52-07:00","id":961632,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/960027-what-monsters-are-left?p=961549#post961549\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That feels far too black and white for the CofD; and perhaps a bit to on the nose regarding intersecting with real world oppressed sexual minorities.<br /> <br /> What seems to mostly separate them from doing this with Vampire, Changeling, or Beast (all of which can easily be twists on the evil seducer stuff in one way or another) is that you're making it a mechanical requirement to obtain consent. The only inherent conflict this leaves is the kind of cartoony, &amp;quot;the Prude Police want to stop your completely consensual sexy fun times!&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> I'm not trying to trivialize the complexity of maintaining multiple relationships (or even a polycule of some sort), but you basically find your way into the primal and poly crowd, and you're 99% set for everything but the Prude Police coming to ruin it for you.</div> </div> </div> </div> Consentually doesn't mean consquence free, or completely ethical. I haven't figured out what possible conquences should be, but I get your point that their should be more shades of grey.<br /> <br /> I'm thinking maybe being fed off by Succubus/Incubus risks/causes sterility and some kind of negative consquence depending on fetish or taint, like risk of a supernatural STD.<br /> <br /> Like the demonic one infects your soul, causing the Soul Loss condition even if your soul is infected and not gone, the the Alien succubi STD causes weird changes in your biology, the Fae Succubi one causes in allergy to cold iron and delusions, the angellic/deific ones causes worshipful obsessions, the ghostly succubus std leaves you vulnerible to possession by ghosts.<br /> <br /> And Supernatural STDs attract the ire of The Chaste.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T07:14:45-07:00","id":961643,"title":"","content":"Okay I looked and I can sort of see it with the Makara, but that more mermaid/siren then Succubus.<br /> <br /> But its not really what I'm going for.<br /> <br /> Maybe change Fetish to Taboo, I like that name better.<br /> <br /> And maybe The Chaste created the Succubi (really need a cool gender nuetral term) as a punished for humans who violated sexual Taboos, in the hopes of purifying humanity, but the Succubi went rogue, rebelled against The Chaste, and they've been at war since.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T07:24:24-07:00","id":961650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/960027-what-monsters-are-left?p=961614#post961614\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I kinda feel like Beast already has the Inccubus/Succubus thing well-covered anyway.</div> </div> </div> </div>Really? While I can kinda see it if forced, Changeling seems to cover it far better. (Psychic Vampire's from Hurt Locker seem like another viable candidate with slight modification/focus).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T07:26:20-07:00","id":961652,"title":"","content":"Qar\u00eenah found it, its like an Egyptian name for Succubi/Incubi.<br /> <br /> <br /> Qarinah: The Taboo<br /> <br /> Taints: Lilitu (Demonic Succubi), Pori (Angellic/Divine Succubi), Venusians (Alien Succubi), N\u00fc Gui (Ghostly Succubi), Leann\u00e1n S\u00eddhe (Fae Succubi).<br /> <br /> Taboos: Oedias, Sades, Sapphos, Babi, Caligulas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 09-01-2016, 11:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T07:37:49-07:00","id":961658,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/960027-what-monsters-are-left?p=961624#post961624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Really? Honestly, reading the Beast core book at no point did I think Succubus. Maybe I'll reread it, but Beasts seem less about sex and seduction, and more about scaring the shit out of people.<br /> <br /> Plus I think my Succubus/Incubus idea explores very different themes then Beast over all, Beast is about fear and hunger, Succubus/Incubus would be about how do you deal with a judgemental society when your sexual nature is so outside the normal and taboo.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the concept of Lilin demons originates in part from sleep paralysis and old hag stories, which is right up Beast's alley, what with their whole primordial dream shtick. Heck, I'd say sexual assault is a primal enough fear it could almost be its own Family, though I think Anakim fit the bill fine.<br /> <br /> Now, if what you're going for is specifically about sexual liberation and breaking taboos, I don't think Beast satisfies that theme. But, I also don't think that's a Succubus/Inccubus story. Lilin demons weren't sexual liberators, they were sexual predators, and Beast is all about predation. Pretty much any of the Hungers could be satisfied through sex, though Tyrants would be the most obvious fit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T07:41:57-07:00","id":961660,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/960027-what-monsters-are-left?p=961650#post961650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Really? While I can kinda see it if forced, Changeling seems to cover it far better. (Psychic Vampire's from Hurt Locker seem like another viable candidate with slight modification/focus).</div> </div> </div> </div>Changeling could work too - both do visit people in their dreams. But, Beast's focus on hunger and predation says &quot;Lilin demon&quot; to me more than Changeling's focus on harvesting emotions. Again, Lilin demons were sexual predators that forced themselves on innocent people in their dreams to satisfy voracious sexual appetites. That definitely seems like something a Beast might do to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T07:47:46-07:00","id":961663,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/960027-what-monsters-are-left?p=961652#post961652\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Qar\u00eenah found it, its like an Egyptian name for Succubi/Incubi.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd go with Lilin. It's the name of the Mesopotamian night spirits, the earliest known mythological creatures with the Inccubus/Succubus shtick. Lilu seduced women in their sleep and Lilitu did the same with men.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T08:02:41-07:00","id":961666,"title":"","content":"I have personally used Liderc as a neutral term for Succubi/Incuubi. Lilin is also appropriate, but I'm already using it as the hebrew term for the strix so I'm biased :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5